# Allow list for scripts/secret-scan.mjs. One entry per line, a reason is mandatory:
#   path <glob> -- <reason>        silence every finding in matching files (no "/" in the glob matches any basename)
#   fp <fingerprint> -- <reason>   silence one exact secret (the scanner prints the fingerprint next to each hit)
# Prefer "fp" over "path": a path entry also hides real secrets added to that file later.

